Read of size 8 at addr ffff888010ac6b98 by task kworker/u4:3/45

CPU: 0 UID: 0 PID: 45 Comm: kworker/u4:3 Not tainted 7.3.0-rc1 #4 PREEMPT(lazy)
Workqueue: repro hci_tx_work
Call Trace:
 <TASK>
 dump_stack_lvl+0xab/0xe0
